REMARKS:
082100Z POSITION NEAR 11.2S 50.2E.
08NOV26. TROPICAL CYCLONE 03S (THREE), LOCATED APPROXIMATELY 488
NM NORTH-NORTHEAST OF ANTANANARIVO, MADAGASCAR, HAS TRACKED
NORTHWESTWARD AT 07 KNOTS OVER THE PAST SIX HOURS. ANIMATED
SHORTWAVE INFRARED IMAGERY DEPICTS A SHALLOW, FULLY EXPOSED
LOW-LEVEL CIRCULATION CENTER DECOUPLED FROM THE DEEP CONVECTION.
A 080615Z ASCAT-C PASS INDICATED THAT MAXIMUM SUSTAINED WINDS
HAVE DECREASED BELOW GALE FORCE. THE UNFAVORABLE ENVIRONMENT OF
MODERATE SHEAR AND MARGINAL SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURES OF 26
DEGREES CELSIUS WILL RESULT IN GRADUAL WEAKENING AND DISSIPATION
OVER WATER BY TAU 36 AS THE CIRCULATION TRANSITS OVER THE
MOZAMBIQUE CHANNEL. THIS IS THE FINAL WARNING ON THIS SYSTEM BY
THE JOINT TYPHOON WRNCEN PEARL HARBOR HI. THE SYSTEM WILL BE
CLOSELY MONITORED FOR SIGNS OF REGENERATION. MINIMUM CENTRAL
PRESSURE AT 081800Z IS 1012 MB. MAXIMUM SIGNIFICANT WAVE HEIGHT
AT 081800Z IS 10 FEET.
